        "detailed_description": "You will play as a protagonist at life's turning point. <br>Battle after battle, you'll uncover the true path of this world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/ec2678358c720816ff9ce3bcd59ee53d.webp?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br><br><br>Combat unfolds in a semi-automated manner.<br>The skill cards you played during the combat will define pivotal moments.​<br>Find your rhythm, manage your resources wisely, and emerge victorious from the swirling chaos of each encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/730054d4019fa5ef80beed7693b114cf.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Following every battle and event, you have the chance to gain new companions.<br>Each of them comes with distinct cards and abilities, creating intriguing synergies with one another.<br>Adapt your lineup to the situation and forge your ideal team.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/b157e767161de4b62316188bcbb047dd.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Each and every character features their own card deck and progression system.<br>As you advance through the game,<br>they'll gradually unlock their latent potential, which will have you regularly reconsidering and adjusting their tactical roles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/2376b9e39ee870589ceb0d3a7418a61b.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Between fights, the tapestry of the story will slowly reveal itself.<br>Main and side stories are interwoven, shedding light on the destinies of both the characters and the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/4f20b643463286deb7d5c8dfba2775ce.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Perhaps nothing can be changed in the very end.<br>Yet, someone is always on the road.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/18e0224489aec75eb8733f6f65c8d21f.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span>",
        "about_the_game": "You will play as a protagonist at life's turning point. <br>Battle after battle, you'll uncover the true path of this world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/ec2678358c720816ff9ce3bcd59ee53d.webp?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br><br><br>Combat unfolds in a semi-automated manner.<br>The skill cards you played during the combat will define pivotal moments.​<br>Find your rhythm, manage your resources wisely, and emerge victorious from the swirling chaos of each encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/730054d4019fa5ef80beed7693b114cf.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Following every battle and event, you have the chance to gain new companions.<br>Each of them comes with distinct cards and abilities, creating intriguing synergies with one another.<br>Adapt your lineup to the situation and forge your ideal team.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/b157e767161de4b62316188bcbb047dd.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Each and every character features their own card deck and progression system.<br>As you advance through the game,<br>they'll gradually unlock their latent potential, which will have you regularly reconsidering and adjusting their tactical roles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/2376b9e39ee870589ceb0d3a7418a61b.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Between fights, the tapestry of the story will slowly reveal itself.<br>Main and side stories are interwoven, shedding light on the destinies of both the characters and the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/4f20b643463286deb7d5c8dfba2775ce.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Perhaps nothing can be changed in the very end.<br>Yet, someone is always on the road.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/18e0224489aec75eb8733f6f65c8d21f.avif?t=1775243762\" width=600 height=240 /></span>",
        "short_description": "Sun Halo is a real-time combat game blending roguelike progression with strategic deck-building. Recruit and develop a roster of distinctive characters, build your own unique deck, and adapt your tactics on the battlefield. Uncover the world’s unfolding story, all the way to its final chapter.",
